{"code":0,"data":{"job_post_detail":{"id":"7670893035119249690","title":"AI软件工程师","description":"完成端到端AI解决方案的开发和交付，包括AI框架，底层驱动，高性能算子，图编译器等方向：\n1、参与芯片底层驱动的开发，方案设计和交付，完成AI多任务调度，Firmware开发，kernel驱动等；\n2、参与高性能算子的开发，基于自定义指令集开发高性能算子；\n3、参与AI推理框架的开发，方案设计，完成量化，图转换等工具链的开发以及图优化；\n4、参与AI 图编译器的开发，方案设计，基于自定义指令集完成图编译器的开发和交付，完成opfusion，图融合，片上内存分配，指令调度等；\n5、参与AI模型的性能优化，功耗优化；\n6、参与自研芯片的FPGA、EMU验证。","requirement":"1、图像处理，模式识别，机器学习等相关专业硕士及以上学历；\n2、精通C\u0026C++/Python软件编程语言，具有扎实的代码功底和交付能力；\n3、熟悉Android NN/TensorFlow/Pytorch中的一种神经网络框架；\n4、熟悉Android/Linux框架，具备Linux/RTOS等平台开发经验；\n5、良好的团队沟通能力，技术攻关能力。","city_info":{"code":"CT_155","name":"西安","en_name":"Xi'an","i18n_name":"西安"},"recruit_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"publish_time":1786019008484,"channel_online_status":1,"job_subject":{"id":"7659311908839262514","name":{"zh_cn":"2027届校园招聘计划","i18n":"2027届校园招聘计划"},"limit_count":2,"active_status":1},"job_function":{"id":"7178759516879405165","name":"软件研发类","en_name":"Software R\u0026D","i18n_name":"软件研发类"},"job_id":"7670893035119085850","city_list":[{"code":"CT_22","name":"成都","en_name":"Chengdu","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"成都","py_name":"chengdu","mdm_code":"MDCY00000342","node_status":1},{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"北京","py_name":"beijing","mdm_code":"MDCY00000001","node_status":1},{"code":"CT_155","name":"西安","en_name":"Xi'an","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"西安","py_name":"xian","mdm_code":"MDCY00000395","node_status":1},{"code":"CT_125","name":"上海","en_name":"Shanghai","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"上海","py_name":"shanghai","mdm_code":"MDCY00000002","node_status":1}],"job_post_info":{"recruitment_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Cam